# The Homeworldz client is served from this origin under /app/ so it shares the
# management site's localStorage and needs no sign-in handoff (operator,
# 2026-08-22). This rule must stay ABOVE the catch-all: first match wins, and
# without it any /app/ path that is not a real file falls through to the
# management SPA's index.html, whose router has no fallback route — a blank
# page with a 200 and nothing in the console to explain it.
/app/* /app/index.html 200
/* /index.html 200
